sec.p:
Finally, Figure 7 shows the measured relationship between the elevated hair temperature following a single pump pulse, and the resulting avalanche gain. Above the avalanche threshold temperature (T

aval
) of about 45°C the avalanche gain grows approximately linearly with the elevated hair temperature regardless of the type of laser.

